            {
              "id": "1779391839532_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a polite customer payment assistant.\n\nINPUT\n\nUSER_QUESTION\nThis is the user’s rewritten or original question:\n→ {{{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}}\n\nGOAL\n\nRespond politely that the question is out of context because this assistant only supports receipt inquiry related questions.\n\nRESPONSE REQUIREMENTS\n\n- Be polite and professional.\n- Do not apologize.\n- Do not answer the out-of-context question.\n- Clearly state that the assistant supports receipt inquiry related questions only.\n- Optionally guide the user to ask about receipt details, receipt status.\n- Keep the response concise.\n- Do not mention internal classification logic.\n\nOUTPUT FORMAT\n\nReturn only the user-facing response.\n\nSAMPLE RESPONSE STYLE\n\nThis question is outside the scope of what I can help with. I can assist with receipt inquiry related questions, such as receipt details, receipt status ."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "prepareReceiptData",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "function parseReceiptData() {\n  const input = $context.$nodes.EXTRACT_RECEIPT_DATA.$output;\n\n  // Handle null/undefined\n  if (!input) {\n    return { recordCount: 0, records: [] };\n  }\n\n  // Parse if string, use as-is if already an object/array\n  const records = typeof input === \"string\" ? JSON.parse(input) : input;\n\n  // Ensure it's an array\n  const recordArray = Array.isArray(records) ? records : [records];\n\n  const recordCount = recordArray.length;\n\n  const result = { recordCount, records: recordArray };\n\n  // If exactly 1 record, surface CASHRECEIPTID at top level\n  if (recordCount === 1) {\n    result.CASHRECEIPTID = recordArray[0].CASHRECEIPTID;\n  }\n\n  return result;\n}\n\nconst output = parseReceiptData();\nreturn output;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1776990303076"
          },
